{
  "schema_version": "1.0",
  "encounter_id": "00854",
  "segments": [
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0001",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 1.08,
      "end_seconds": 11.94,
      "duration_seconds": 10.86,
      "text": "Right. I'm here because my partner says I've got a temper, and I need to sort it. I don't want to lose my job."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0002",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 14.53,
      "end_seconds": 20.24,
      "duration_seconds": 5.71,
      "text": "Thank you for coming. Tell me what's been happening."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0003",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 22.38,
      "end_seconds": 35.52,
      "duration_seconds": 13.14,
      "text": "I get short with people. At work, at home. Small things, someone leaves a door open, and I blow. I shout. Then I feel terrible."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0004",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 38.59,
      "end_seconds": 42.72,
      "duration_seconds": 4.13,
      "text": "How long has this been going on?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0005",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 44.9,
      "end_seconds": 53.03,
      "duration_seconds": 8.13,
      "text": "A year? Maybe longer. I can't say when it started. It got worse after Christmas."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0006",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 55.93,
      "end_seconds": 59.87,
      "duration_seconds": 3.94,
      "text": "Has anything changed in your life? ~"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0007",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 62.14,
      "end_seconds": 71.55,
      "duration_seconds": 9.41,
      "text": "A new boss. A new baby, eight months ago. I'm not sleeping, and money's tight. ~"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0008",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 72.96,
      "end_seconds": 75.31,
      "duration_seconds": 2.35,
      "text": "How's your sleep?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0009",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 78.12,
      "end_seconds": 81.5,
      "duration_seconds": 3.38,
      "text": "Four hours a night, broken."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0010",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 83.07,
      "end_seconds": 87.48,
      "duration_seconds": 4.41,
      "text": "Any thoughts of harming yourself, or anyone else?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0011",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 89.88,
      "end_seconds": 94.01,
      "duration_seconds": 4.13,
      "text": "No. No, I'd never. Not anyone."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0012",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 96.66,
      "end_seconds": 99.38,
      "duration_seconds": 2.72,
      "text": "What are you taking?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0013",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 101.97,
      "end_seconds": 118.53,
      "duration_seconds": 16.56,
      "text": "Propranolol, 10 mg, when I feel wound up, but not sure it does anything. Something for my stomach, omeprazole, 20 mg. And I take St John's wort, maybe 300 mg, a day."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0014",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 121.01,
      "end_seconds": 135.88,
      "duration_seconds": 14.87,
      "text": "I need to stop you there, because St John's wort interacts with a lot of drugs. So it's 300 mg, as you recall it. Any other conditions?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0015",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 137.46,
      "end_seconds": 140.37,
      "duration_seconds": 2.91,
      "text": "Acid reflux. That's all."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0016",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 142.42,
      "end_seconds": 146.39,
      "duration_seconds": 3.97,
      "text": "Do you drink, or use any substances?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0017",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 149.54,
      "end_seconds": 156.78,
      "duration_seconds": 7.24,
      "text": "A few beers at night, to switch off. Four, five. And lots of coffee."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0018",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 159.41,
      "end_seconds": 165.18,
      "duration_seconds": 5.77,
      "text": "And what do you do for exercise, or to relax?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0019",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 167.19,
      "end_seconds": 169.27,
      "duration_seconds": 2.08,
      "text": "Nothing. No time."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0020",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 170.68,
      "end_seconds": 175.22,
      "duration_seconds": 4.54,
      "text": "Let me check your pulse and blood pressure. ~"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0021",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 177.49,
      "end_seconds": 179.07,
      "duration_seconds": 1.58,
      "text": "Fine. ~"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0022",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 190.09,
      "end_seconds": 194.63,
      "duration_seconds": 4.54,
      "text": "Pulse 84, blood pressure 138 over 88."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0023",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 195.79,
      "end_seconds": 198.09,
      "duration_seconds": 2.3,
      "text": "Is that okay? ~"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0024",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 200.47,
      "end_seconds": 208.35,
      "duration_seconds": 7.88,
      "text": "Slightly raised, which fits with stress and the alcohol. Any breathlessness, chest pain?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0025",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 210.64,
      "end_seconds": 211.99,
      "duration_seconds": 1.35,
      "text": "No."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0026",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 213.84,
      "end_seconds": 230.23,
      "duration_seconds": 16.39,
      "text": "Right. Putting this together, irritability and outbursts for a year, poor sleep, a new baby, work stress and heavy-ish drinking, I'd say this is stress-related irritability, probably with sleep deprivation and alcohol feeding it."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0027",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 231.86,
      "end_seconds": 239.51,
      "duration_seconds": 7.65,
      "text": "Is that all? I thought I might be bipolar or something. ~"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0028",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 240.73,
      "end_seconds": 251.72,
      "duration_seconds": 10.99,
      "text": "Nothing you've described points that way. But I'd like to check your thyroid and a few other things, because they can cause irritability."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0029",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 254.24,
      "end_seconds": 256.02,
      "duration_seconds": 1.78,
      "text": "Okay. ~"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0030",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 258.26,
      "end_seconds": 274.07,
      "duration_seconds": 15.81,
      "text": "Cut the beer to a couple of units, not every night, and stop the St John's wort, it can interact with other things. Cut the coffee after midday."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0031",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 276.73,
      "end_seconds": 278.24,
      "duration_seconds": 1.51,
      "text": "Right. ~"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0032",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 279.57,
      "end_seconds": 286.37,
      "duration_seconds": 6.8,
      "text": "And I'd like you to try a short anger-management course, and talking therapy."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0033",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 288.94,
      "end_seconds": 291.17,
      "duration_seconds": 2.23,
      "text": "Will that help? ~"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0034",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 293.31,
      "end_seconds": 301.83,
      "duration_seconds": 8.52,
      "text": "It does, for most. I'd like to see you again in three weeks."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0035",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 302.97,
      "end_seconds": 305.97,
      "duration_seconds": 3.0,
      "text": "Three weeks. Thanks. ~"
    }
  ]
}
